{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-project-page-js","path":"/projects/raw","result":{"data":{"allAirtable":{"edges":[{"node":{"data":{"title":"RAW","slug":"raw","type":"Logo","description":"RAW 1251AM is the student radio station at The Univerity of Warwick. They approached me with the desire to come up with a new and modern look to their society with the key being a minimilistic feel. The rebrand took months of planning and designing with several concepts being drafter up before reaching a conclusion everyone was pleased with. This rebrand even won an award at the SRA's (Student Radio Association) awards night as the best audience initiative. The logo was designed in Adobe Illustartor.","tech":["illustrator"],"link":null,"date":"2016-12-31","artwork":{"localFiles":[{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1.8796992481203008,"src":"/static/a79ec07797500592d8ca201f2eaba28e/348a3/vW2R07rkH_NbndsKhdhEUXBLWnauw1g1WXiVFIUdlXs.png","srcSet":"/static/a79ec07797500592d8ca201f2eaba28e/e1953/vW2R07rkH_NbndsKhdhEUXBLWnauw1g1WXiVFIUdlXs.png 250w,\n/static/a79ec07797500592d8ca201f2eaba28e/46604/vW2R07rkH_NbndsKhdhEUXBLWnauw1g1WXiVFIUdlXs.png 500w,\n/static/a79ec07797500592d8ca201f2eaba28e/348a3/vW2R07rkH_NbndsKhdhEUXBLWnauw1g1WXiVFIUdlXs.png 801w","sizes":"(max-width: 801px) 100vw, 801px"}}},{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1.968503937007874,"src":"/static/7bfdc4f58b86f4c0238dc0c47df37fde/ae33e/yU2OuKX-DO8JiF677En0qLTOoPG78Uh2dkjG-18TfdQ.png","srcSet":"/static/7bfdc4f58b86f4c0238dc0c47df37fde/e1953/yU2OuKX-DO8JiF677En0qLTOoPG78Uh2dkjG-18TfdQ.png 250w,\n/static/7bfdc4f58b86f4c0238dc0c47df37fde/46604/yU2OuKX-DO8JiF677En0qLTOoPG78Uh2dkjG-18TfdQ.png 500w,\n/static/7bfdc4f58b86f4c0238dc0c47df37fde/ae33e/yU2OuKX-DO8JiF677En0qLTOoPG78Uh2dkjG-18TfdQ.png 818w","sizes":"(max-width: 818px) 100vw, 818px"}}},{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":2.212389380530973